---
description: SchoolAI institutional website rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Read AGENTS.md, README.md and active docs under docs/ before implementation. Follow their constraints: preserve brand and split hero; English only; Markdown for institutional/editorial copy (including publication records) and Google Sheets for the six feeds; Astro for presentation only; no hardcoded editorial content in `.astro`/`.ts`; external editorial media URLs only (except authorised TWINT/Stripe QR assets); typographic publication cover fallback when no HTTPS cover is set; independent repositories/apps and hyperlinks; preserve public legacy URLs; no invented content, private data or unauthorized publication. Prefer small reviewable commits on the approved branch for the task. Treat docs/archive/ as historical only. Website 2027 migration is closed. Report discrepancies before making architectural decisions.
